sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Người dùng
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant BM as bug-management
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant R as Outbox relay
  participant K as Kafka
  participant IN as integration
  participant SS as system-setting
  U->>GW: POST /bug/update/status
  GW->>BM: proxy có chữ ký
  BM->>DB: BEGIN; cập nhật bug; ghi bug_histories; ghi event_outbox_bug; COMMIT
  BM-->>U: 200
  R->>DB: đọc outbox chưa phát
  R->>K: tms.bug.v1 bug.status_changed
  K->>IN: consumer integration-jira
  IN->>IN: đặt tác vụ CONVERGE (gộp theo active_key)
  K->>SS: consumer thông báo
  SS->>DB: ghi notification (khử trùng bằng inbox)
